      <title>Condominium sells for $830,000 in Dublin</title>
      <link>https://www.mercurynews.com/2026/03/04/condominium-sells-for-830000-in-dublin/</link>
      <description>A 1,200-square-foot condominium, built in 1986, has changed hands. The condo in the 7600 block of Arbor Creek Circle in Dublin was sold on Dec. 18, 2025 for $830,000, or $692 per square foot. The apartment has three bedrooms and three bathrooms. Additionally, the condo has access to a double carport.</description>
